 and it is really annonying.\n\nAt first i thought it was that my game was to big, so i created an empty project just a Node2d as a main scene but the problem was still here. No GDExtension or GDScript were used in this empty project.\n\nBut when i tested in Godot 4.3 stable version and previous versions (from 4.0 to 4.3 stable versions only), the problem is disappear.\n\nI have put the log of when i used 4.3 stable and 4.4 stable.\n\n[godot-4.3.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19871814/godot-4.3.log)\n[godot-4.4.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19871815/godot-4.4.log)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust run a game in the editor in debug mode, even with an empty main scene it works.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19871843/test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105688/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":14,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}